      },
      "message": "feat(v5.18.0): enforce Two-Phase github-research execution\n\n- Fix: Router now executes research FIRST (prerequisite, not hint)\n- Fix: Added \"research\" to router triggers for explicit user requests\n- Add: SKILL_HINTS detection for explicit research keywords\n- Add: RESEARCH_EXECUTED gate before planner\n- Change: Simplified github-research skill (31% smaller)\n- Change: Updated Integration Points to reflect Two-Phase model\n\nResolves issue where planner was ignoring SKILL_HINTS for github-research.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
